{"id":"ad55d3b2dfeece56","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck.md","title":"Sacks–Uhlenbeck Theorem","display":"thm-sacks-uhlenbeck — Sacks–Uhlenbeck Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck","aliases":["58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck"],"display":"thm-sacks-uhlenbeck — Sacks–Uhlenbeck Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sphere]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-uhlenbeck — Sacks–Uhlenbeck Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3db83908de2fd3e1\" href=\"?note=3db83908de2fd3e1\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map\">../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere\">../batch08/58-df-sphere</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact\">../batch05/58-df-compact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,g)\">\\((N,g)\\)</span> (compact Riemannian manifold)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S^2,g_{S^2})\">\\((S^2,g_{S^2})\\)</span> (standard Riemannian two-sphere)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0\\in N\">\\(n_0\\in N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2(N,n_0)\">\\(\\pi_2(N,n_0)\\)</span> (pointed second homotopy group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_g\">\\(\\tau_g\\)</span> (topology induced on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\)</span> (Riemannian-manifold predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S\\)</span> (harmonic-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S\\)</span> (pointed homotopy-group predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic compatibility predicates defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}topology}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau,N,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\n\\tau=\\left\\{U\\subseteq N\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\{y\\in N\\mid d_g(x,y)&lt;r\\}\\subseteq U\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}topology}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau,N,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\n\\tau=\\left\\{U\\subseteq N\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\{y\\in N\\mid d_g(x,y)&lt;r\\}\\subseteq U\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}round\\text{-}sphere\\text{-}metric}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S^2,g_{S^2})\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in S^2\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_xS^2\\;\ng_{S^2,x}(v,w)=\\sum_{i\\in3}v_iw_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}round\\text{-}sphere\\text{-}metric}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S^2,g_{S^2})\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in S^2\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_xS^2\\;\ng_{S^2,x}(v,w)=\\sum_{i\\in3}v_iw_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}uhlenbeck}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau_g,N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(N,\\tau_g)\n\\land n_0\\in N\n\\land\\exists G,\\star,s_0,p_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,N,\\tau_g,n_0,2,s_0,p_2)\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in G\\;(a\\neq b)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists u\\in N^{S^2}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(u,S^2,g_{S^2},N,g)\n\\land\\exists x,y\\in S^2\\;(u(x)\\neq u(y))\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}uhlenbeck}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau_g,N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(N,\\tau_g)\n\\land n_0\\in N\n\\land\\exists G,\\star,s_0,p_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,N,\\tau_g,n_0,2,s_0,p_2)\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in G\\;(a\\neq b)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists u\\in N^{S^2}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(u,S^2,g_{S^2},N,g)\n\\land\\exists x,y\\in S^2\\;(u(x)\\neq u(y))\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sacks and Uhlenbeck obtain the harmonic sphere by studying critical points of the perturbed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-energy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\alpha(u)=\\int_{S^2}(1+|du|^2)^\\alpha\">\\(E_\\alpha(u)=\\int_{S^2}(1+|du|^2)^\\alpha\\)</span> as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\downarrow1\">\\(\\alpha\\downarrow1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Compactness can fail only through bubbling; a nontrivial bubble supplies the asserted nonconstant harmonic two-sphere.</li>\n<li>Nontriviality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_2\\)</span> is now expressed through the registered nine-place homotopy-group predicate, and the topology used for compactness is tied to the Riemannian metric.</li>\n<li>The differential-geometric constructions remain explicitly at the metatheoretic boundary, matching the harmonic-map dependency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map","status":"resolved","id":"3db83908de2fd3e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(N,g)","display":false},{"tex":"(S^2,g_{S^2})","display":false},{"tex":"n_0\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_2(N,n_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_g","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemannian\\text{-}topology}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau,N,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\n\\tau=\\left\\{U\\subseteq N\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\{y\\in N\\mid d_g(x,y)<r\\}\\subseteq U\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}round\\text{-}sphere\\text{-}metric}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(S^2,g_{S^2})\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in S^2\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_xS^2\\;\ng_{S^2,x}(v,w)=\\sum_{i\\in3}v_iw_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}uhlenbeck}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannianTopology}_S(\\tau_g,N,g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(N,\\tau_g)\n\\land n_0\\in N\n\\land\\exists G,\\star,s_0,p_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HomotopyGroup}_S(G,\\star,N,\\tau_g,n_0,2,s_0,p_2)\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in G\\;(a\\neq b)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RoundSphereMetric}_S(g_{S^2})\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists u\\in N^{S^2}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(u,S^2,g_{S^2},N,g)\n\\land\\exists x,y\\in S^2\\;(u(x)\\neq u(y))\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\alpha(u)=\\int_{S^2}(1+|du|^2)^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\downarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_2","display":false}],"bytes":2787,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4399","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck.md|58-thm-sacks-uhlenbeck]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["3db83908de2fd3e1","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","c682c089b3ac3182","ed44d43cf74ca35e","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}